<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>504 — Gateway Timeout · Scan to See</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,300..700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        :root {
            --bg:      #0f0a07;
            --accent:  #6b9fff;
            --muted:   #7a6a5a;
            --sand:    #fffbf4;
            --border:  rgba(255,255,255,.08);
        }

        html, body { height: 100%; }

        body {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--sand);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 24px;
        }

        /* ── Brand ── */
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 56px;
        }
        .brand img {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }
        .brand-name {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
            letter-spacing: .02em;
        }

        /* ── Error card ── */
        .card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 52px 48px;
            max-width: 520px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .err-icon {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .err-code {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1;
            color: var(--accent);
            letter-spacing: -.03em;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .err-title {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .err-body {
            font-size: .95rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.45);
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        /* ── Spinning clock ── */
        .clock-wrap {
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .clock {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(107,159,255,.35);
            border-radius: 50%;
            position: relative;
        }
        .clock::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%; left: 50%;
            width: 2px; height: 14px;
            background: var(--accent);
            transform-origin: bottom center;
            transform: translate(-50%, -100%);
            border-radius: 2px;
            animation: tick 2s linear infinite;
        }
        .clock::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%; left: 50%;
            width: 2px; height: 10px;
            background: rgba(107,159,255,.6);
            transform-origin: bottom center;
            transform: translate(-50%, -100%) rotate(90deg);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        @keyframes tick {
            from { transform: translate(-50%, -100%) rotate(0deg); }
            to   { transform: translate(-50%, -100%) rotate(360deg); }
        }

        /* ── Buttons ── */
        .btn-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn-refresh {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: var(--bg);
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: .9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity .15s, transform .12s;
            letter-spacing: .01em;
        }
        .btn-refresh:hover { opacity: .85; transform: translateY(-1px); }

        .btn-home {
            display: inline-block;
            background: transparent;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.6);
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: .9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 11px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
            transition: border-color .15s, color .15s, transform .12s;
            letter-spacing: .01em;
        }
        .btn-home:hover {
            border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.45);
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        .foot {
            margin-top: 48px;
            font-size: .75rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.18);
        }

        @media (max-width: 540px) {
            .card { padding: 36px 24px; }
            .err-code { font-size: 4.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="brand">
        <img src="{{ asset('image/logoS2S.png') }}" alt="S2S logo">
        <span class="brand-name">Scan to See</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="err-icon">⏳</div>
        <div class="err-code">504</div>
        <h1 class="err-title">Our waiter is taking forever…</h1>
        <p class="err-body">
            Something upstream is moving at a snail's pace today.<br>
            Give it a moment, then try refreshing — it usually sorts itself out.
        </p>
        <div class="clock-wrap">
            <div class="clock"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="btn-row">
            <button class="btn-refresh" onclick="location.reload()">Refresh page</button>
            <a href="/" class="btn-home">Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="foot">&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Scan to See. All rights reserved.</p>

</body>
</html>
